  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community Stabilization and Reconciliation through Livelihoods Recovery in Post-crisis Areas of Southern Somalia (CSR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &apos;Community-Led Stabilization and Reconciliation through Livelihoods Recovery in Post-Crisis Areas of Southern Somalia&apos; (CSR) project is a continuation of UNIDOs livelihoods recovery programme in postcrises environments like Iraq, Afghanistan, Lebanon, northern Uganda, Sudan, and South-Sudan. It is a well integrated conflict-reduction and technical assistance programme that is designed to operate in complex environments.</narrative>
  </description>
